_count":0,"impression_count":4628,"like_count":9,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"目前全球有50多个国家允许一夫多妻制度，通常最多只能拥有4位合法妻子。\n\n一夫多妻的核心门槛不是“胆量”，是“钱包”。在允许的国家，实际实行比例不到2%。毕竟，养一个家已经掏空六个钱包，养几个家？怕不是要卖肾？"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-18T00:16:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089506807450595690"],"id":"2089506807450595690","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5678,"like_count":10,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我有一个朋友去年去澳门亏了500万。\n\n但他没哭，也没闹，甚至没怎么失眠。\n\n他叫老陈，是个做了二十年的建筑造价师。这辈子，他最擅长的就是把一堆钢筋水泥、人工杂费算得清清楚楚，精确到小数点后两位。在他的世界里，万物皆有价，一切皆可算。"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-17T08:11:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089263831965106582"],"id":"2089263831965106582","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":5516,"like_count":3,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"text":"A9级别的大佬喜欢什么样的女人？\n\n1、气质大于五官\n\n2、情绪极致的稳定\n\n3、绝对忠诚守口如瓶\n\n4、独立思想与“人生合伙人”\n\n5、懂分寸识大体"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-17T03:28:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089192703271772634"],"id":"2089192703271772634","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":6352,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":2},"text":"天天这样的夜局，这样的00后商K妹子陪你喜欢吗？ https://t.co/VwYyhT7Gz0"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-17T01:26:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089161919911612613"],"id":"2089161919911612613","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4845,"like_count":6,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":1},"text":"币圈牛市几月启动？\n\n1、9月\n\n2、10月\n\n3、11月\n\n4、牛已死，漫长熊市继续持续"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-16T13:30:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2088981834000720323"],"id":"2088981834000720323","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4417,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":1},"text":"做交易久了，最大的感悟就是：人最大的敌人，永远是自己的手。\n\n以前总觉得，不时刻盯着K线、不亲自按下买卖键，心里就不踏实。结果呢？熬红了眼，熬乱了心态，最后往往是在情绪最崩溃的时候，做出了最错误的决定。\n\n后来才明白，真正的顶级自律，不是死磕，而是学会“放手”。 https://t.co/fbSTXUDWx1"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-16T12:50:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2088971745894301891"],"id":"2088971745894301891","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1503,"impression_count":299550,"like_count":2345,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":67,"retweet_count":94},"text":"一部被低估的韩国大尺度犯罪爽片 https://t.co/CsD9XJpxAL"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-16T00:09:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2088780217922060327"],"id":"2088780217922060327","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3220,"like_count":5,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"怎么看2026的经济到底有多差？\n\n1、座高铁飞机的越来越少\n\n2、座绿皮大巴的越来越多\n\n（白户越来越少，黑户限高的越来越多）"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-15T08:57:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2088550645934830074"],"id":"2088550645934830074","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":97,"impression_count":15152,"like_count":165,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":7},"text":"大尺度经典港片系列 https://t.co/2vDCsTFSPp"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-15T03:04:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2088461855425740853"],"id":"2088461855425740853","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4308,"like_count":8,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"湖南加油站女员工，勇斗人贩子救下女童。 https://t.co/KRVhHHyzop"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-15T01:10:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2088433100464464148"],"id":"2088433100464464148","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3539,"like_count":6,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":1},"text":"给美美的吉他换上新的琴弦，她们说要四十几分钟？卧槽！我以前自己十几分钟搞定，兄弟们，有会换的吗？ https://t.co/yCXskiLS17"}],"users":[{"id":"3097944448","name":"浪子燕青","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2095719838446665730/8QFP8Ev8_normal.jpg","usern